and then release them?

64
00:02:34.320 --> 00:02:36.690
Yeah, so TNR, Trap Neuter Return

65
00:02:36.690 --> 00:02:39.610
so it's the humane alternative for death in euthanasia

66
00:02:39.610 --> 00:02:40.446
for stray of feral cats.

67
00:02:40.446 --> 00:02:41.279
Oh gosh!

68
00:02:41.279 --> 00:02:44.120
So catch the cats in humane traps

69
00:02:44.120 --> 00:02:46.500
I take them to Atlanta Humane Society

70
00:02:46.500 --> 00:02:48.750 line:15%
I get them spayed, neutered, vaccinated

71
00:02:48.750 --> 00:02:50.570 line:15%
